標題: 失落的半獸人王族

    一. 起點: 遠風鎮營地(/d/noden/recamp/camp1 )
    二. 主旨: 露露覆活,獲得搭帳棚技能。
    三. 等級: 三。
    四. 略解: 帳棚( camp4 )     (touch picture,down)
   => 石室( camp_wall ) (search here,kill sheet,search box,get all)
   => 水池( camp_pool ) (wet stone)
   => 石室( camp_wall ) (apply wall,squeeze wall)
   => 地道( camp5 )     (give paper to fool) (get explore)
   => 18,4.noden        (give paper to statue)
   => 17,14.noden       (give paper to statue)
   => 3,5.noden         (give paper to statue)
   => 2,15.noden     (give paper to statue) (will be k..get explore)     
   => 地道( camp5 )  (give paper to lulu,finish quest can train camp skill)

